{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-title='Apache HTTPD'>\r\n\t\t\tApache HTTPD\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on mode_rewrite samples: Remove Extension, Redirect all, and Remove trailing slash.","label":"mode_rewrite samples","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mod_rewrite","label":"mod_rewrite","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mod_rewrite"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/proxy_server","label":"Proxy Server","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/proxy_server"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Remove Extension<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME}\\.html -f<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteRule ^(.*)$ $1.html.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Redirect all<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteRule ^(.*)$ index.php.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRedirect to www.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^1freehosting.com.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteRule (.*) http:\/\/www.1freehosting.com\/$1 [R=301,L].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRedirect to naked.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} !^mydomain\\.com [NC].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteRule ^\/?(.*)$ http:\/\/mydomain.com\/$1 [L,R=301].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Remove trailing slash<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDirectorySlash Off.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>RewriteCond        %{REQUEST_FILENAME} -d<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>RewriteCond RewriteRule        ^(.)*$        $1\/&lt;root.html&gt;        [L]<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mode_rewrite_samples\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mode_rewrite_samples\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mod_rewrite' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mod_rewrite' data-title='mod_rewrite' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>mod_rewrite<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/proxy_server' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/proxy_server' data-title='Proxy Server' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/res